; Audited against data/effects.txt TEXT, lines 2484-2513; corrected locally.
; COUNTER.SPELL=214 is the single source of truth; field 216 is not used.
; CAN_HOLD_SPELL_COUNTER=215 must indicate that one more counter can be placed.
; Self.246 records last transfer turn + 1 (initialize to zero). Choose a legal
; target before removing a counter; use native COUNTER operations for events.
; Effect 3 receives native CounterChanged (32), whose EVENT_SUBJECT is the
; counter attribute address. Effect 2 also resolves its own zero-counter cleanup.

; Pitch-Black Power Stone: effect 1 (ACTIVATION, optional=0)
.program 34029630_1
PC Instruction Meaning
    0 ATTRIBUTE A2, A0, #3                                                        
    1 LOAD V2, A2                                                                 
    2 COMPARE F0, V2, #4, EQUAL                                                   
    3 JUMPIF F0, 10, FALSE                                                        
    4 ATTRIBUTE A2, A0, #4                                                        
    5 LOAD V2, A2                                                                 
    6 COMPARE F0, V2, #1, EQUAL                                                   
    7 JUMPIF F0, 10, FALSE                                                        
    8 ATTRIBUTE A2, A0, #214                                                      
    9 COUNTER SET, A2, #3                                                         
   10 HALT                                                                        
.end

