   62 COMPARE F0, V2, #0, EQUAL                                                   
   63 JUMPIF F0, 71, FALSE                                                        
   64 ATTRIBUTE A2, A0, #14                                                       
   65 LOAD V2, A2                                                                 
   66 SELECT A3, [0:3:0]                                                          
